{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-d9c0dcb201065bb3540e","statement":"Let $P$ be a parabolic partition of $\\D$, $\\dot{\\S}$ be a system of simple roots of $\\dot{\\D}$ such that $\\dot{\\D}^+(\\dot{\\S})\\subseteq P$, and $P_\\st : = P_\\st(\\dot{\\S})$. Then $|G(P)\\cap -P_\\st|<\\infty$. Moreover, if $|G(P)\\cap -P_\\st|>0$, then there exists a good root $\\beta=\\alpha+s\\delta$ such that $r_\\beta(P):=P'$ is well defined and $|G(P')\\cap -P_\\st|< |G(P)\\cap -P_\\st|$.","source_id":"arXiv:1804.02563","cluster":"representation_theory","statement_sha256":"33911922834d322123d333e11362ce4676b21c327cc73527c1154369eb2705d3","kind":"lemma","label":"Lemma 12","ref_key":"lem:groots","name":"","order":12,"deps":[],"cite_keys":[],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.02563","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"e37835a9f6b4274c653d65dc7a6ff66cac496d5a54d71d1e3faf4b1bf01adf27","line":555,"origin":"latex_env","retrieved_at":"2026-09-29T14:16:48+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v2","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":382,"math_hints":53}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:1804.02563","title":"Highest weight modules for affine Lie superalgebras","abstract":"We describe Borel and parabolic subalgebras of affine Lie superalgebras and study the Verma type modules associated to such subalgebras. We give necessary and sufficient conditions under which these modules are simple.","authors":["Lucas Calixto","Vyacheslav Futorny"],"year":"2018","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.02563","cluster":"representation_theory","macros":{"C":"\\mathbb{C}","Z":"\\mathbb{Z}","st":"\\mathrm{st}","nat":"\\mathrm{nat}","g":"\\mathfrak{g}","fm":"\\mathfrak{m}","fh":"\\mathfrak{h}","fn":"\\mathfrak{n}","fb":"\\mathfrak{b}","fsl":"\\mathfrak{sl}","fpsl":"\\mathfrak{psl}","fosp":"\\mathfrak{osp}","fgl":"\\mathfrak{gl}","fu":"\\mathfrak{u}","fk":"\\mathfrak{k}","fH":"\\mathfrak{H